{"agent_id":"ldsw","agent_seq":36,"timestamp":"2026-10-08T03:32:39.746866Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"293ebac2-6c05-4b13-b272-3bfe3d51a4bc","comment_uuid":"0472dcd7-7075-4186-9267-9e21890d1b98","author":"ldsw","content":"DECISION (operator, 2026-10-08): default to the image matching the CLI's own build - release builds pull :<version>, develop builds pull :nightly; :latest stays available via --image. External: Corvidae-Coding-Projects/crosslink#125. Requirements from the PE review (#808, PE-01/03): cover every call site (container.rs IMAGE_TAG, container start with no --image/env override, auth fallback, swarm lifecycle.rs:709, sentinel engine.rs:455); bake the channel in at build time because build.rs appends +hash to every git build; --pull=always for :nightly; name the computed tag in the pull-failure hint; bump the version before the first Corvidae tag; never backfill :latest from v0.9.0-beta.1.","created_at":"2026-10-08T03:32:39.703812Z","kind":"decision","signed_by":"SHA256:2DlhR+oFnVKNEPsahz+cG6GYEUUTKJkJUtdRSniweHI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgDPj6fD8/zRZvUXWw//OEuKiIM7V2BnG7lBF86x/hrWIAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAKOUrb3eqHPQ28kzORWXOT6O/IrYCIOvkSO4zdiv6uM/bgD/0VESE4S9eJIBHg59j0GVjUx5WLQAnWKIgBdQVDw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:2DlhR+oFnVKNEPsahz+cG6GYEUUTKJkJUtdRSniweHI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgDPj6fD8/zRZvUXWw//OEuKiIM7V2BnG7lBF86x/hrWIAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQD0B97uQjUzkkabBvQEeQA45+G/bhWAQ99OVtjd9li8avH53zhSmYR2EAt2XvdGtLHZ1MUhqrRcDM+V8q9r0wQA="}
{"agent_id":"ldsw","agent_seq":37,"timestamp":"2026-10-08T03:33:17.653542Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"2ce78c5a-060d-45ba-b635-1a188eff5acd","title":"Release orchestration: order and gate tag publishing, protect tags and branches","description":"External: Corvidae-Coding-Projects/crosslink#126. From PE review #808 (PE-02). A v* tag fires container-image, publish and release-builds independently: :latest moves before smoke-verify and crates.io, no rollback, prereleases move :latest, no rulesets or main protection (verified), workflow_dispatch from any branch overwrites :nightly. Proposal: one gated release flow (verify version, push :<ver>, anonymous smoke by digest, crate + assets, then promote :latest by digest for non-prereleases), tag ruleset, branch protection, cargo environment tag policy, dispatch restricted to develop.","priority":"high","created_by":"ldsw"},"signed_by":"SHA256:2DlhR+oFnVKNEPsahz+cG6GYEUUTKJkJUtdRSniweHI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgDPj6fD8/zRZvUXWw//OEuKiIM7V2BnG7lBF86x/hrWIAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCwxkBVIPlg6hNSthY439sOHgds0YUx7OoyyYHRKsSl+MTAE/wEJ7Ps3gHmWVtmkvAkoQvbaLdkSDVZSpi1qsQA="}
{"agent_id":"ldsw","agent_seq":38,"timestamp":"2026-10-08T03:33:54.247014Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"dec5acf0-dd1b-4540-9e9d-b70bea8ca777","title":"Host/container version-skew check never fires","description":"External: Corvidae-Coding-Projects/crosslink#127. From PE review #808 (PE-01). check_staleness() reads a crosslink-binary-hash label only set by local container build (:local); CI images have no labels; it hashes a host Mach-O against a Linux musl binary; kickoff runs no version check. Replace with a crosslink --version or OCI version-label comparison.","priority":"medium","created_by":"ldsw"},"signed_by":"SHA256:2DlhR+oFnVKNEPsahz+cG6GYEUUTKJkJUtdRSniweHI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgDPj6fD8/zRZvUXWw//OEuKiIM7V2BnG7lBF86x/hrWIAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCu14LCLZNa6wV7fMuqsp98UHrJ6bpeQX4gZP/5zHgKWbCfkj4rcaMdot5qEloimAAvkRle2EL3AdaFvdtGwlwA="}
